  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview 3 fixes config-driven build ordering. Compile groups are now topologically\n      sorted by inter-project app.json dependencies before being grouped by settings, so\n      apps split into separate groups by a differing 'define' (or any other setting) build\n      in dependency order instead of by config-file position — fixing spurious \"dependency\n      not found\" failures. Also removes the unused tooling.bcToolsVersion config field. See\n      CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
